{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:28:32+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I've Fallen For You!", "steam_appid": 2754690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reignite your passion and experience a love without regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how many times, I always want to embrace you, for only then can I avoid being lost in the long nights of rain and snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2024, we present with heartfelt craftsmanship, &quot;I've Fallen For You!&quot; Once again, let your passion be stirred and experience a profound and regretless love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I may never see the moon at noon, but I know it is always there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your heart, I may never touch it, yet I can always feel it clearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight women simultaneously appear in your life, offering you unconditional love and support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you choose to uphold your beliefs and become a good man, or give in to human temptations and become a bad man?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introduction</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yu Anxia#Puppy Love #Gentle as Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/88746e4e4efeef1a17c130f222b322e4.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/88746e4e4efeef1a17c130f222b322e4.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/88746e4e4efeef1a17c130f222b322e4.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wang Yi Chen#Cute Girl #Deep Sibling Bond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/9cb87aa82623a262c0fe3af41c23b64e.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/9cb87aa82623a262c0fe3af41c23b64e.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/9cb87aa82623a262c0fe3af41c23b64e.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracy#Hong Kong-style Milf #Confident＆Independent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/71b0ec14136c1e8369adfe718d4db213.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/71b0ec14136c1e8369adfe718d4db213.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/71b0ec14136c1e8369adfe718d4db213.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Song Jing#Mature Lady #Childhood Sweetheart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/c779179061f44e7f73616326dcbc91cd.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/c779179061f44e7f73616326dcbc91cd.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/c779179061f44e7f73616326dcbc91cd.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kawase Nana#Japanese Girl #Money-oriented</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/06f2d80ad081d2699d217355a3d8bc1f.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/06f2d80ad081d2699d217355a3d8bc1f.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/06f2d80ad081d2699d217355a3d8bc1f.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jiang Mi#Fashion Reporter #Innocent＆Sweet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/5a0e573ac3ab26ce8abc196087066b58.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/5a0e573ac3ab26ce8abc196087066b58.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/5a0e573ac3ab26ce8abc196087066b58.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Selina#Blonde Executive #Adorable yet Knowledgeable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/cc90bb5c8cf0860b5ff77c6b72380bb0.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/cc90bb5c8cf0860b5ff77c6b72380bb0.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/cc90bb5c8cf0860b5ff77c6b72380bb0.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Xu Xinqing#Scheming Heiress #Wealthy＆Cunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/7cffe6009825d1d9c42b34cd08b215d7.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/7cffe6009825d1d9c42b34cd08b215d7.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/7cffe6009825d1d9c42b34cd08b215d7.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Gathering of Beauties from Various Places, Encounter Enchanting Scenery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popular beauties from different regions come together, each showcasing their unique charm and allure. From the adorable girl-next-door to the fiery DJ, the fierce and commanding lady, and the pure, innocent beauty, an array of captivating personas creates a dazzling mosaic that will leave you enchanted and mesmerized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself and Experience the Waves of Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the immersive sensation as if you were there in the first person. In this unique experience, it will seem as though you are truly part of it, feeling every subtle detail and every emotional wave. This total engagement will draw you in, immersing you deeply, making it hard to pull away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotional Roller Coaster Storyline, Surprises and Tears</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the adorable journey of a blonde female executive in her professional life, the emotional conquest of a fierce lady boss, the passionate beats of a fiery DJ, the deep bonds of a sweet sister, and the heartfelt promises of an exceptionally charming young beauty. Each character plays an indispensable role in the storyline, adding layers of surprise and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nested Multiple Endings, Collect Precious Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices in the game will lead to various endings, including normal endings, perfect endings, hidden endings, and Easter egg endings, which are interwoven and triggered in different ways. This provides players with a rich gaming experience. Explore multiple clues, experience various endings, challenge your decision-making skills, and enjoy the endless fun the game brings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Fun Games, Endless Surprises and Joy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into delightful mini-games that break away from rigid fixed choices. The outcome is entirely based on luck, making every decision an unpredictable adventure. Unlock mysterious paths and discover a series of surprising and exciting storylines that keep you on your toes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exclusive Music Album: Diary of Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every song is a beautiful memory, each with a touching story. The perfect blend of storyline and music creates an enchanting experience where the melodies and lyrics capture the essence of each love story. The album is infused with rich emotional elements, taking listeners on a journey through heartfelt memories.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reignite your passion and experience a love without regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how many times, I always want to embrace you, for only then can I avoid being lost in the long nights of rain and snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2024, we present with heartfelt craftsmanship, &quot;I've Fallen For You!&quot; Once again, let your passion be stirred and experience a profound and regretless love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I may never see the moon at noon, but I know it is always there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your heart, I may never touch it, yet I can always feel it clearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight women simultaneously appear in your life, offering you unconditional love and support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you choose to uphold your beliefs and become a good man, or give in to human temptations and become a bad man?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Introduction</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yu Anxia#Puppy Love #Gentle as Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/88746e4e4efeef1a17c130f222b322e4.poster.avif?t=1732672542\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/88746e4e4efeef1a17c130f222b322e4.webm?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754690/extras/88746e4e4efeef1a17c130f222b322e4.mp4?t=1732672542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wang Yi Chen#Cute Girl #Deep Sibling Bond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play